<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25218" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jējūnĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				fasting, emptiness of stomach</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jejunitatis plenus, anima foetida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc. 3, 3, 13</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>dryness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calida umoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					2, 6, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 4,
			3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of speech, <i>dryness, poverty, meagreness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inopia et jejunitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Brut. 55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui jejunitatem et famem se malle quam
					ubertatem et copiam dicerent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 2, 1, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jejunitas et siccitas et inopia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Brut. 82, 285</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Ignorance</i> of any thing: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bonarum artium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					de Or. 2, 3, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
